{
  "_what": "Every verb of the mail screen with its title, the words that find it and its place in the palette (parts/ui/show/command-table rows). A verb's KEY is not here: it is the row `mail-<verb>` of keymap.json (scope `mail`), so the card, the bar and the menus draw the key the person's Shortcuts settings give it, and re-recording it there changes the hint everywhere. Add a verb by adding a row here, its icon in mail-actions.json and, if it has a key, a `mail-<verb>` row in keymap.json.",
